  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid black .75pt;padding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You know how to sink into your work. When you use this action, your form changes in a way that matches your medium; you might dissolve into a flowing liquid of colors, a flutter of pages and letters, a whirl of smoke, or a cascade of ink. When you enter this form you gain your choice of either a fly or burrow speed of 30 feet, and have a +2 circumstance bonus to your AC and saving throws against any reactions you trigger with a Move or Manipulate action.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.0OTUDcGITkPmQ0sx]{Effect: Flowstate}</p>"
